# Non-Dual Awareness — ~30 min — brief settle 10 -> long FLAT hold 7 Hz -> return 10
# Goal: open / non-dual "choiceless awareness". The design intent is STABILITY and
#       SPACIOUSNESS, not stimulation — a steady low theta-alpha border with minimal
#       change. No gamma chasing, no sweeps inside the hold. Scaffolding for open
#       monitoring; the receptive state is the practitioner's own, not the device's.
# Bands: brief alpha settle 10 Hz; long flat hold at the theta-alpha border 7 Hz;
#        gentle return 7->10 Hz. (Research: altered_states_transcendent_meditation.md,
#        Arc B — steadiness matters more than depth-chasing; forcing frequency changes
#        can disrupt an established open state.)
# Driver: binaural, freq_r FIXED 210 Hz; beat = freq_r - carrier. carrier 200 => 10 Hz,
#         carrier 203 => 7 Hz (inaudible <4 Hz carrier move; freq_r NOT interpolatable, 5a).
# LED: dim violet-BLUE flicker tracks the beat 1:1 (all <=10 Hz, safe); a slow, gentle
#      breathing brightness LFO (12 s period) is the ONLY movement during the hold.
# SAFETY (guidelines §4): every rate <=10 Hz (below the 15-25 Hz photosensitive band);
#   brightness capped <=22% with a floor, ramps in 15 s, fades out 60 s (both >=10 s),
#   never stopped abruptly; violet-blue only (no saturated red, no red<->blue flicker);
#   binaural carrier 200 Hz (<1000), offset = beat <=10 Hz (<35); volume fades in 60 s.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a segment
# BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row's value.

# --- Brief settle / alpha (00:00-05:00, beat 10 Hz): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 60 30 200 5          # LED 10 Hz violet-blue flicker; brightness ramps 0->18% over 15 s
A 0 200 0 >0 0 1 210 0           # binaural: carrier 200 / freq_r 210 => 10 Hz beat; vol fades 0->50 over 60 s
S 3000 default 20 "Settle, and let the breath find its own rhythm. Nowhere to go, nothing to fix."
15000 10 50 18 60 30 200 5      # brightness reaches 18% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 10 50 ~8:22:12000 60 30 200 5   # slow breathing LFO: brightness sine 8<->22% over 12 s
A 60000 200 0 100 0 1 210 0       # alpha settle holds: carrier 200, vol steady 50 to 05:00

# --- Descend to the theta-alpha border (05:00-06:30, beat 10->7 Hz, gentle) ---
A 300000 >200 0 100 0 1 210 0     # carrier ramps 200->203 (beat 10->7) over 90 s; vol holds 50
300000 >10 50 ~8:22:12000 60 30 200 5  # LED 10->7 lockstep with the beat
S 300000 default 20 "Let awareness open and rest wherever it is. Choose nothing; receive everything."

# --- Long FLAT open hold (06:30-26:00 = 19.5 min, beat 7 Hz, deliberately steady) ---
A 390000 203 0 100 0 1 210 0      # carrier fixed 203 => beat 7 Hz held perfectly flat (no sweeps)
390000 7 50 ~8:22:12000 60 30 200 5    # dim violet-blue 7 Hz; only the slow breathing LFO moves
S 600000 default 20 "Rest in open awareness — nothing to do, nothing to hold."
S 1080000 default 20 "Let awareness be vast and still, like a clear sky holding every passing cloud."

# --- Gentle return (26:00-29:00, beat 7->10 Hz) ---
A 1560000 >203 0 100 0 1 210 0    # carrier ramps 203->200 (beat 7->10) over 3 min
1560000 >7 50 ~8:22:12000 60 30 200 5  # LED 7->10 lockstep
S 1560000 default 20 "Gently returning, carrying this stillness with you."

# --- Soft close (29:00-30:00): vol + brightness fade to 0 over 60 s ---
A 1740000 200 0 >100 0 1 210 0    # beat back at alpha 10; vol ramps 50->0 over final 60 s
1740000 10 50 >18 60 30 200 5   # brightness fades 18->0 (>=10 s), preempts LFO
S 1740000 default 20 "Back at ten hertz. Gently return to the room, spacious and rested."
A 1800000 200 0 0 0 1 210 0      # end: volume 0
1800000 10 50 0 60 30 200 5     # end: brightness 0

S 1800000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1810000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 1820000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 1830000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
